 star on the Disney Channel from  2007 to 2012  Selena played Alex Russo on Wizards of  Waverly Place after leaving the Disney  Channel Selena pursued a music career  and quickly  topped the charts as one of the best  female artists she's accomplished so  much that it's easy to forget where her  journey all began do you remember when  Selena portrayed Mikaela on a Hannah  Montana she appeared in a total of three  episodes which aired from 2007 to 2008  Hannah and Mikayla were on-screen rivals  they constantly competed for a spot in  the limelight they were total frenemies  Sierra McCormick Sierra McCormick is  only 22 years old but she's already got  a huge online following she first made  waves when she was cast as Emma on the  hilarious  TV series Curb Your Enthusiasm but in  2009 Sierra would appear in a single  episode of Hannah Montana alongside one  of her future ant farm co-stars Sierra  appeared in the episode titled welcome  to the bungle she portrayed a young girl  named Jillian who was one of Hannah's  biggest fans during a Q&amp;A interview  Jillian asked Hannah whether or not she  liked to read and totally broke down in  front of everyone while she didn't have  the biggest role on the sitcom Sierra  would go on to star as olive Doyle on  ant farm from 2011 to 2014 if you want  to see more of Sierra keep an eye out  for the upcoming film exploited Sierra  has been cast as Chloe one of the lead  characters exploited is all set to make  its grand debut sometime in 2020 Chyna  and MacLean and last but not least is  the beautiful and talented China and  McClain who is currently playing  Jennifer Pierce aka lightning on the hit  TV series Black Lightning china anne  mcclain is a child actor who has made  quite the name for herself in Hollywood  she landed her first acting gig in 2005  and has continued to add to her  portfolio ever since China has made it  big as a Disney Channel star she's well  known for playing uma and The  Descendants series and just like Sierra  McCormick Chyna got her start on Hannah  Montana before starring as Chyna parks  on ant farm  Chyna and Sierra both appeared in the  episode titled welcome to the bungle  Chyna was cast as Isabel an extremely  devoted fan of Hannah Montana's Chyna is  a triple threat in real life she  demonstrated her mini talents in  descendants 2 &amp; 3 and  if the franchise can't imagine anyone  else trying to fill Emma's shoes it's  easy to forget that China once had a  small role in Hannah Montana after all  she's been cast in so many productions  that is hard to keep up with her back in  the early 2000s Hannah Montana was one  of Disney Channel's most popular sitcoms  and tons of up-and-coming stars snagged  minor roles that would help them further  their careers so we all owe Miley a huge  thank-you and that's a wrap on the 10  stars you forgot we're on Hannah Montana  before you go tell us what your favorite  Disney Channel show is in the comments  below one of our favorites is Andy Mack  thanks for watching don't forget to  subscribe and be sure to give this video  a big thumbs up we'll see you next time  on the things

